# The F/P's first class node, and the payoff for a book that spends every job
# laying poison. Fifteen orbs, plus one for each burn stack already on the
# group, up to twenty-five.
#
# It scatters, like Megiddo Flame. Each orb finds its own enemy, and orbs that
# double up keep 55% of their final damage, so a crowd takes one orb each and a
# lone boss takes them all. GMS aims them at the highest-HP boss first, which is
# what sending extra strikes to the healthiest already does.
#
# The count is what makes this the F/P's own skill and not just another nuke.
# Cast at the start of a fight it throws fifteen; after Poison Mist, Ifrit,
# Inferno Aura and the current swing, twenty or more; on a map where every mob
# burns it is at the cap. It reads the group live each time, so the chooser
# learns the cooldown is worth more once the poisons are down.
#
# GMS's `time 20` is how long an orb hunts before it expires, not a beat: the
# client gives no interval, so all of them land together.
name: "DoT Punisher"
description:
  "Summons flame orbs from another dimension to pursue enemies. The flame "
  "orbs target the boss with the highest HP first. The number of orbs you "
  "summon depends on how many damage-over-time stacks you have on enemies."
kind: SKILL_KIND_ATTACK
tags: SKILL_TAG_FIRE
placement { job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_FIRE_POISON_ARCH_MAGE_V skill_order: 1 }
v_node: V_NODE_KIND_JOB
max_level: 30
required_equip_type: EQUIP_TYPE_STAFF
base_delay_ms: 510
cooldown_seconds: 25.0
max_enemies: 25
lines: 5
base { skill_pct: 4.15 }
per_level { skill_pct: 0.15 }
scatter {
  hits: 15
  repeat_final_dmg_pct: -0.45
  hits_per_dot: 1.0
  max_hits: 25
}
dot {
  interval_seconds: 1.0
  duration_seconds: 8.0
  lines: 1
  base { skill_pct: 2.03 }
  per_level { skill_pct: 0.03 }
}
